STITCH_TOKEN not available — design thumbnail not fetched.

To fetch the Stitch thumbnail and screen JSON, set STITCH_TOKEN in your environment and run:

mkdir -p docs/evidence
# thumbnail (PNG)
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $STITCH_TOKEN" "https://api.stitch.google/v1/screens/45ac4478a1b7455f861d7377f92105e6/thumbnail?size=1024" -o docs/evidence/design-reference.png

# full screen JSON
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $STITCH_TOKEN" "https://api.stitch.google/v1/projects/13629074018280446337/screens/45ac4478a1b7455f861d7377f92105e6" -o docs/evidence/screen-45ac4478.json

Stitch screen URL:
https://stitch.withgoogle.com/projects/13629074018280446337/screens/45ac4478a1b7455f861d7377f92105e6

